/-!
# Shared coordinate evaluations for row six

The ascending PC words are evaluated in the original binary basis.
Existing checked PC products are reused, and only missing products are checked here.
The displacement tables are shared by all pair-rank certificates.
Source context: Aschbacher–Smith A.3.12, printed pp.47–48;
Kleidman–Wilson (1988), pp.484–510. ATLAS attribution is in Janko4.Model.Data.
Witness tables are generated locally; all arithmetic is checked by Lean's kernel.
-/

